	| Format   | Plain                 |
	| Priority | 2                     |
	| Status   | Archived              |
	| Type     | General               |
	And I create a note for the account "Korzen - ${staticCompanyName}" with the following values
	| Content  | Account Note9 Content |
	| Format   | HTML                  |
