	And the ticket with keywords "Korzen - ${staticCompanyName}" should have the subject "New Subscription for Korzen - ${staticCompanyName}"
	And the ticket with keywords "Korzen - ${staticCompanyName}" should have the text "Account Name: Korzen - ${staticCompanyName}" in its description
