	And the ticket with keywords "Korzen - ${staticCompanyName}" should have the text "Warning" in its description
	And the ticket with keywords "Korzen - ${staticCompanyName}" should have the text "Maximum contacts is 0 but there are 1 contacts" in its description
	And the ticket with keywords "Korzen - ${staticCompanyName}" should have the requester with the email address "provisioningrequest@liferay.com"
	And the ticket with keywords "Korzen - ${staticCompanyName}" should have the organization "Provisioning"
	And the ticket with keywords "Korzen - ${staticCompanyName}" should have the product "prd_provisioning_request"
	And the ticket with keywords "Korzen - ${staticCompanyName}" should have the support region "United States"
	And the ticket with keywords "Korzen - ${staticCompanyName}" should have the opportunity owner "pro.koroneiki1@lrcustomer.com.broken"
	And the ticket with keywords "Korzen - ${staticCompanyName}" should have the primary address country "United States"

Scenario: View global region ticket warning from empty sold by field
	Testing the ability to create a regular project in Dossiera and viewing the project in the form of a zendesk ticket with a global region warning

	Given I generate several static variables for Provisioning
	And I generate a provisioning company name
	And I generate a provisioning project name
	And I publish a project with no partner RabbitMQ message on sandbox with routing key "dossiera.provisioning.create" with the following values
	| Account Name                           | Korzen - ${staticCompanyName}              |
	| Address City                           | Diamond Bar                                |
	| Address Country                        | United States                              |
	| Address Postal Code                    | 91765                                      |
	| Address Region                         | California                                 |
	| Address Street                         | 456 Fake Street                            |
	| Contact Email Address                  | pro.koroneiki1@lrcustomer.com.broken       |
	| Contact First Name                     | PRO                                        |
	| Contact Last Name                      | Koroneiki1                                 |
